 "note": "The places on the farm map and what belongs to them (game/farm/spots.gd reads this; moved out of the code 12 Oct 2026). Where each place stands is in map_layout.json. names: id -> [name, emoji] (names are translated in data/i18n/ui-<lang>.json). interiors: buildings with an inside; built = once this (or an upgrade) is done the map shows the building and a tap opens the inside with its corners (members). insideArt: pictures of the corners inside (assets/interior/<id>.png, then assets/map/<id>.png), the newest one built is shown. artChains: the upgrade chain of a place, first to last; its picture follows the newest one built (pictures are named after the first stage they stand for). plotChains: places lying flat on the ground (pens, gardens, the pond), picture in assets/plots/<id>.png, buildings stand on them as add-ons. alwaysOpen: open before anything is built. ruins: what is left before a building stands again (stone or wood). bench: tool pictures shown on the workbench once done (x, y, w = fractions of the bench picture); item = an item in the store counts. pens: fence picture (assets/fences/, empty = none), ground (earth | grass | meadow), dirt = share of bare earth. Which place a data node belongs to: ruinsAt (ruins_<place> are cleared at that place), slotPrefixes, then slots by the node's slot (a place id, or byId / byPrefix / default), then defaultPlace.",
